        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 426, Standard Door Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSimple in design and even easier installation, this door knob will not disappoint those looking for an elegant way to improve the style of any home. The circular rose has concealed screw mounting (installation screws are hidden) for a very smooth look. It fits any standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door preparation. The 426 Omnia Knob is available in either polished brass or polished chrome finishes. Available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions for 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\" or 2\" door thicknesses with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAll critical interior parts are made of brass. Tough, non-rusting materials are used throughout. All dimensions are standard to fit existing bores for easy replacement installations.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Classic Door Knob With Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 426 Simple Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> for the Omnia 426/00 Standard Solid Brass 2 Inch Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door by using a 7mm solid spindle. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Uses 7mm split spindle. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Standard Solid Brass 2 Inch Knob, Omnia 426/00",
                "description": "Omnia 426/00 Simple Solid Brass Knobset - Simple in design and even easier installation, this door knob will not disappoint those looking for an elegant way to improve the style of any home. The circular rose has concealed screw mounting (installation screws are hidden) for a very smooth look. It fits any standard 2-1/8 inch bore hole door preparation. The 426 Omnia Knob is available in either polished brass or polished chrome finishes. Available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions for 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch or 2 inch door thicknesses with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
